# Both pipelines' images build from the workspace root (docker build -f packages/<pipeline>/Dockerfile .).
# Keep the build context small: an image needs only the workspace definition (pyproject.toml,
# uv.lock, .python-version, packages/*/pyproject.toml), fisseq-common's and its pipeline's
# src/ and README.md, and the embeddings pipeline's snakemake/. testing_data/ alone is many GB
# (the real-starcall fixture's download cache).
.git
**/.github
**/.devcontainer
**/.devcontainer-tmp
.venv
.venvs
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.nextflow
**/.nextflow.log*
**/work/
**/.snakemake/
**/site/
docs/
**/docs/
tests/
**/tests/
**/starcall-workflow/
**/testing_data/
**/scratch/
**/outputs/
**/weights/
**/*.pth
